{"step_index":268,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T21:16:43Z","content":"All 25 videos with dates and views. Now I can calculate monthly earnings. YouTube pays around the **21st of each month** for the previous month's earnings:","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Month-by-month AdSense earnings breakdown for Just Explained based on video upload dates, view counts, and channel RPM of $6.07. Shows YouTube payment schedule (paid ~21st of following month).","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Just Explained — Monthly AdSense Earnings Breakdown\n\n> **Channel RPM: $6.07** | YouTube pays ~21st of next month for previous month's earnings\n> ⚠️ These are **estimates** based on total view counts + upload dates. Actual daily views fluctuate.\n\n---\n\n## Month-by-Month Journey\n\n### Month 1 — December 2025 (Paid ~Jan 21, 2026)\n| Video | Views |\n|-------|-------|\n| Every TV Screen Explained in 12 Minutes | 6,700 |\n| **Monthly total views** | **~6,700** |\n| **Estimated earnings** | **~$41** |\n| 💳 YouTube payment | ❌ Not monetized yet (need 1K subs + 4K hours) |\n\n---\n\n### Month 2 — January 2026 (Paid ~Feb 21, 2026)\n| Video | Views |\n|-------|-------|\n| Every type of Computer Explained | 3,600 |\n| Every Mental Disorder & Its Effects Explained | 1,400 |\n| All Continents Explained | 1,100 |\n| **Monthly total views** | **~6,100** |\n| **Estimated earnings** | **~$37** |\n| 💳 YouTube payment | ❌ Likely still not monetized |\n\n---\n\n### Month 3 — February 2026 (Paid ~Mar 21, 2026)\n| Video | Views |\n|-------|-------|\n| Every Type of AI Explained | 17,000 |\n| **Monthly total views** | **~17,000** |\n| **Estimated earnings** | **~$103** |\n| 💳 YouTube payment | ❌ Probably still working toward 1K subs |\n\n---\n\n### Month 4 — March 2026 (Paid ~Apr 21, 2026)\n| Video | Views |\n|-------|-------|\n| Every FAILED TV Brand Explained | 15,000 |\n| All Ice Creams Explained | 1,700 |\n| Every Chocolate Explained | 744 |\n| All Pizza Styles Explained | 5,700 |\n| **Monthly total views** | **~23,144** |\n| **Estimated earnings** | **~$140** |\n| 💳 YouTube payment | ⚠️ May have hit monetization threshold here |\n\n---\n\n### Month 5 — April 2026 (Paid ~May 21, 2026)\n| Video | Views |\n|-------|-------|\n| Every Smart TV OS explained | **245,000** 🔥 |\n| **Monthly total views** | **~245,000** |\n| **Estimated earnings** | **~$1,487** |\n| 💳 YouTube payment | ✅ **First real paycheck: ~$1,487** |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **This is the breakout month.** \"Every Smart TV OS\" was the first video to go semi-viral. One video generated more views than all previous videos combined.\n\n---\n\n### Month 6 — May 2026 (Paid ~Jun 21, 2026)\n| Video | Views |\n|-------|-------|\n| Every Operating System Explained | **345,000** 🔥 |\n| Every Web Browser Explained | **95,000** |\n| All Features Apple Removed | 8,600 |\n| **Monthly total views** | **~448,600** |\n| **Estimated earnings** | **~$2,723** |\n| 💳 YouTube payment | ✅ **~$2,723** |\n\n---\n\n### Month 7 — June 2026 (Paid ~Jul 21, 2026)\n| Video | Views |\n|-------|-------|\n| Every Windows Version Explained | 26,000 |\n| Every Form of Government Explained | 2,500 |\n| Every Mobile Network Explained | 21,000 |\n| Every Way People Watched TV | 36,000 |\n| Every Underrated Tech Invention | 6,800 |\n| **Monthly total views** | **~92,300** |\n| **Estimated earnings** | **~$560** |\n| 💳 YouTube payment | ✅ **~$560** |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Dip month.** 5 videos uploaded but none went viral. Plus older videos' views slowed down. This happens — not every month is a banger.\n\n---\n\n### Month 8 — July 2026 (Paid ~Aug 21, 2026)\n| Video | Views |\n|-------|-------|\n| Every AI Model Explained | **171,000** |\n| Every Type of TV SCREEN | 10,000 |\n| Every Illegal Operating System | **1,100,000** 🚀💥 |\n| Every USB Port COLOR | **794,000** 🔥 |\n| **Monthly total views** | **~2,075,000** |\n| **Estimated earnings** | **~$12,595** |\n| 💳 YouTube payment | ✅ **~$12,595** 🤑 |\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **EXPLOSION MONTH.** \"Every Illegal Operating System\" hit **1.1M views** and \"Every USB Port COLOR\" hit **794K**. This single month earned more than all previous months combined. This is when the channel blew up.\n\n---\n\n### Month 9 — August 2026 (Will be paid ~Sep 21, 2026)\n| Video | Views (so far, month not over) |\n|-------|-------|\n| Every Programming Language Explained | **273,000** |\n| Every Illegal OS Part 2 | 53,000 |\n| Most Dangerous Computer Viruses | 23,000 (3 days old) |\n| + Tail views from July viral videos | ~est. 200,000+ |\n| **Monthly total views (so far)** | **~549,000+** (month not over) |\n| **Estimated earnings (so far)** | **~$3,332+** |\n| 💳 YouTube payment | 📅 Will be paid ~September 21, 2026 |\n\n---\n\n## Summary Table — The Full Journey\n\n| Month | Period | Videos | Monthly Views | Est. Earnings | YouTube Payment Date |\n|-------|--------|--------|--------------|---------------|---------------------|\n| 1 | Dec 2025 | 1 | 6,700 | ~$41 | ❌ Not monetized |\n| 2 | Jan 2026 | 3 | 6,100 | ~$37 | ❌ Not monetized |\n| 3 | Feb 2026 | 1 | 17,000 | ~$103 | ❌ Not monetized |\n| 4 | Mar 2026 | 4 | 23,144 | ~$140 | ⚠️ Getting monetized |\n| **5** | **Apr 2026** | **1** | **245,000** | **~$1,487** | **~May 21** ✅ |\n| **6** | **May 2026** | **3** | **448,600** | **~$2,723** | **~Jun 21** ✅ |\n| 7 | Jun 2026 | 5 | 92,300 | ~$560 | ~Jul 21 ✅ |\n| **8** | **Jul 2026** | **4** | **2,075,000** | **~$12,595** | **~Aug 21** ✅ 🤑 |\n| 9 | Aug 2026 | 3+ | 549,000+ | ~$3,332+ | ~Sep 21 📅 |\n\n---\n\n## Total Estimated Lifetime Earnings: **~$21,018**\n\n> [!TIP]\n> **The pattern is clear:** Months 1-4 earned almost nothing (~$321 total). Then ONE viral video in April changed everything. July was the jackpot month — **$12,595 from a single month.** That's 60% of all lifetime earnings from one month.\n>\n> **Lesson:** In the tech explainer niche, you grind for 4-5 months making quality content, and then ONE video can change your entire trajectory.\n","Description":"Month-by-month AdSense earnings breakdown for Just Explained channel","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\justexplained_monthly_earnings.md","toolAction":"Creating earnings breakdown","toolSummary":"Monthly earnings report"}}]}
